# Paths that stay in the repository but never leave it in a distributed artifact.
#
# `git archive` is what tools/package.py runs for the source-tarball build
# (ENCODE_SOURCE=false), and export-ignore is the only way to drop a *tracked*
# path from it. The frozen build has its own exclusion (`excludes` in
# easyokapi.spec).
#
# devtools/ is the developer-only performance monitor behind main.py's
# --monitor flag. It is not a secret — it is tracked on `main` on purpose — it
# simply is not part of what a user receives. See devtools/README.md.
/devtools export-ignore
